ight, by the hidden lift, and tell nobody.')],\n 's4':[('teddy','alarmed','There is a lift behind the morgue. There is an actual lift behind the morgue.'),('bashir','neutral','There are several things behind the morgue, Doctor Lark. This is merely the first you have been introduced to.')],\n 's4b':[('bashir','soft','Rest, Doctor. You did what one pair of hands can do.'),('mara','alarmed','It was not enough. It was only one beat of enough.'),('teddy','soft','Somebody get her tea. Not the machine tea. Real tea.')],\n 's5':[('pet','stern','I retired to stop being called at three in the morning. Look at the clock, Ottoline.'),('voss','stern','It says three in the morning. I apologise to the clock.'),('pet','soft','Show me the man. And do not tell me he is important. They are all important at three.')],\n 's5b':[('pet','stern','Everyone out. Doctor Lark, you will hold her up. The child sits down and she breathes.'),('teddy','alarmed','Yes, Doctor Nwosu. Right away, Doctor Nwosu. Please do not look at me like that.')],\n 's6':[('pet','soft','Eleven years. I held your hand through three of your divorces, Ottoline.'),('voss','stern','You held my coat. It is not the same.'),('narrator','neutral','The monitor over the table begins, very quietly, to count in five.')],\n 's6b':[('pet','stern','The Foundation sent lilies. Lilies, in a hospital. I have seen subtler warnings in a mafia film.'),('teddy','alarmed','Should somebody tell the staff not to smell them?'),('narrator','neutral','Nobody does. It is the kindest, most terrible bouquet in Port Verity.')],\n 's7':[('pet','stern','Child. Listen to me. He taught you to count, and you will count for him.'),('mara','soft','One. Two. Three. And the fourth beat is mine.')],\n 's7b':[('teddy','soft','He is awake. He is awake and he is already correcting my grammar.'),('bashir','neutral','Doctor Lark. It was \"I will do it.\" Not \"I did it, mostly.\"'),('narrator','neutral','Outside, the rain stops for the first time since the Wing opened. Nobody in the building quite dares to say so.')],\n 'epilogue':[('vane','soft',\"They have found my little song, have they not. How lovely. They are going to be so wonderful at the next one.\")],\n}\nfor sid,lines in add_end.items():\n    block=''\n    for who,expr,text in lines:\n        text=text.replace('\"','\\\\\"')\n        block+=f'[[scene.line]]\\nwho = \"{who}\"\\nexpr = \"{expr}\"\\ntext = \"{text}\"\\n'\n    m=re.search(r'\\[\\[scene\\]\\]\\nid = \"%s\"\\n'%sid,s)\n    assert m,sid\n    nxt=s.find('\\n[[scene]]',m.end())\n    if nxt==-1: s=s.rstrip('\\n')+'\\n'+block\n    else: s=s[:nxt].rstrip('\\n')+'\\n'+block+s[nxt:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs'\nt=open(p).read()\nt=t.replace('    assert!(lines >= 100, \"{lines} story lines\");','    let callouts: usize = content.cases.iter().flat_map(|c| c.phase.iter()).map(|p| p.say.len()).sum();\\n    assert!(lines + callouts >= 150 && lines + callouts <= 300, \"{lines} story lines + {callouts} callouts\");')\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\np='crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/bot.rs'\nb=open(p).read()\nb=b.replace(\"\"\"            if h.k == Kind::Eye && h.aux > 0.5 {\n                return false;\n            }\"\"\",\"\"\"            if h.k == Kind::Eye && h.aux > 0.5 {\n                return false;\n            }\n            // Case 7's partner does the support work; the strains are the player's.\n            if g.case == 7 && s == 1 && !g.attract && !g.sg[0].bot && g.partner_support {\n                if !matches!(h.k, Kind::Pool | Kind::Lace | Kind::Bleeder | Kind::Hook | Kind::Polyp | Kind::Burn) {\n                    return false;\n                }\n            }\"\"\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(b)\np='crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs'\nm=open(p).read()\nm=m.replace(\"    pub one_hit: bool,\\n\",\"    pub one_hit: bool,\\n    pub partner_support: bool,\\n\",1)\nm=m.replace(\"            one_hit: false,\\n\",\"            one_hit: false,\\n            partner_support: true,\\n\",1)\nm=m.replace('            \"rank\": self.results.as_ref().map(|r| r.rank.clone()),','            \"rank\": self.results.as_ref().map(|r| r.rank.clone()),\\n            \"result_total\": self.results.as_ref().map(|r| r.total),\\n            \"par\": self.case_def().par,',1)\nopen(p,'w').write(m)\nPYEOF\ngrep -c \"scene.line\" crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content/story.toml; grep -n \"partner_support\" crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/*.rs | head"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4132,"cache_read_input_tokens":504845,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4132},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4040135-dd9a-415a-bbb7-ba7a9152393c","uuid":"261c93b2-c6a9-4563-9125-59f324ae57b3","timestamp":"2026-11-05T15:35:23.108Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk2WJMTiMVVo7ZbwTHf6","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01KceT2VLbMubv9SV4Bx5zJt":{"command":"cat > /tmp/x_$$.py <<'E'\nE\nrm -f /tmp/x_$$.py\npython3 - <<'PYEOF'\nimport re\np='crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content/story.toml'\ns=open(p).read()\nadd_end={\n 's0':[('mara','soft','Anton Deverell mends nets. I have never mended anything bigger than a hem.'),('bashir','neutral','A net is only a wound that has learned to hold water, Doctor. Go.')],\n 's0b':[('narrator','neutral','The rain keeps its own time against the glass. Somewhere below, a monitor answers it, beat for beat.')],\n 's1':[('teddy','alarmed','I will be on the machines. If anything beeps in a way I do not like, I will say so loudly and with several swear words.'),('mara','neutral','Please say them quietly.')],\n 's1b':[('bashir','soft','For what it is worth, Doctor, I would not have found the artery that fast.'),('mara','alarmed',