{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk8TboosrpmkCfGXhpe8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013tihPL52snvQKW2cV8jMh2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ../../engine && python3 - <<'E'\np='crates/pav_view/src/surgery/plates.rs'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('''            p.veins = 0.8;\n            p.vein = lin(240, 180, 90);\n            p.lobes = vec![l(-1.0, 0.2, 18.0, 8.0, 1.5), l(3.0, -0.5, 9.0, 5.0, 0.7)];''','''            p.veins = 0.45;\n            p.vein = lin(150, 50, 60);\n            p.lobes = vec![l(-1.0, 0.2, 18.0, 8.0, 1.5), l(3.0, -0.5, 9.0, 5.0, 0.7)];''',1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='crates/pav_app/src/product.rs'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"            if let Some(sc) = c.strip_prefix(\"screen:\") {\"\"\",\"\"\"            if let Some(t) = c.strip_prefix(\"mode_t:\") {\n                prod.shell.mode_t = t.parse().unwrap_or(0.0);\n                continue;\n            }\n            if let Some(sc) = c.strip_prefix(\"screen:\") {\"\"\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='crates/pav_app/src/hook.rs'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"            if let Some(c) = v.get(\"shell\").and_then(|c| c.as_str()) {\n                HOOK.with(|k| k.borrow_mut().shell.push(format!(\"screen:{c}\")));\"\"\",\"\"\"            if let Some(c) = v.get(\"shell\").and_then(|c| c.as_str()) {\n                HOOK.with(|k| k.borrow_mut().shell.push(if c.starts_with(\"mode_t:\") { c.to_string() } else { format!(\"screen:{c}\") }));\"\"\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='../tests/browser/shots.py'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('g.step(60 * 6); snap(\"results.png\")','g.step(60 * 6); g.do({\"shell\": \"mode_t:6.0\"}); snap(\"results.png\")')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nE\ncat > ../README.md <<'E'\n# Tempo Trauma: dev folder\n\nAn original surgical-action drama on the Pavilion engine (the shardfall repository, commit 49ef2ba).\nThe title lives in one constant, `pav_core::games::surgery::TITLE`.\n\n- `engine/` the engine with the game added: `crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/` (sim, bot, cases, story, tuning),\n  `crates/pav_view/src/surgery/` (operative field, instruments, paper theatre), `crates/pav_ui/src/surgery/`\n  (shell, HUD, glyphs), `crates/pav_audio/src/{cues,voice,music}.rs`, `crates/pav_app/src/{product,hook}.rs`\n  (the game's own frame path, test hook, AI Hub bridge), `web/{hub_shim.js,hub_tags.html}`, `scripts/pack_single_html.py`.\n- `tests/run_all.py` one command, prints only failures and a count (`--rust`, `--web`, `--hub`); `tests/browser/` Playwright\n  tests and screenshot script; `tests/hub/` the AI Hub harness; `tests/out/` screenshots.\n- `exit-interview.json`, `make_about.py` (regenerates the About screen's data from it), `about-data.json`.\n- Content guide: `engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content/README.md`.\n\nBuild the single file (needs Rust 1.98.1 with the wasm32 target and wasm-bindgen 0.2.129):\n\n    cd engine && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=3 scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene surgery/title --title \"Tempo Trauma\" \\\n      --description \"...\" --theme-color \"#0a1a1e\" --about ../about-data.json --out ../<name>.html\n\nTools: `pav play scene=surgery/campaign bot=true seeds=10`, `pav capture scene=surgery/case/3 ticks=600 out=a.png`,\n`pav case_check`, `pav balance seeds=10`.\nE\necho ok"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5754,"cache_read_input_tokens":627977,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5754},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4040135-dd9a-415a-bbb7-ba7a9152393c","uuid":"547a50a0-9fe4-4924-85b9-c79ce14defa9","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:53:29.573Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk8