{"type":"system","subtype":"background_tasks_changed","tasks":[{"task_id":"bqnbusihf","run_id":"0mw3sf9pa-c6c65844","task_type":"local_bash","description":"cd ../.. && python3 - <<'E'\nimport json\np='exit-interview.json'\nd=json.load(open(p))\nd['testingFeedback'][0]=\"Twelve real defects: a forceps grab that never fired when the trigger was already held, an Echo repeat that invalidated an index and panicked, an unreachable Case 7 nodule (the Scanner slot becomes the Cryoprobe there), a tendril the bot could not pull far enough, an idle player that won Case 7 through the partner bot, a story script under the plan's length, par values that left the bot at rank B, lost menu key taps between slow frames, a test hook that sent the wrong screen command, a Case Files jump that skipped the chart card, hub clients that stayed silent until play began, and a late ready() call.\"\nd['testingFeedback'][1]=\"Five: the covered-hook grab that soft-locked Case 0, the Echo panic, the unreachable Case 7 nodule, the tendril that could not be finished (Case 4 could never be won), and the silent hub clients (the hub's own check fails a game that does not talk both ways).\"\njson.dump(d,open(p,'w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nE\npython3 make_about.py && cd engine && until [ \"$(free -m | awk '/Mem:/{print $7}')\" -gt 3000 ]; do sleep 5; done; CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=3 scripts/build-web.sh --single-file --scene surgery/title --title \"Tempo Trauma\" --description \"A surgical-action drama: race a failing heart, with the pulse as the game's clock.\" --theme-color \"#0a1a1e\" --about ../about-data.json --out ../TempoTrauma-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261105-073255.html > ../webbuild.log 2>&1; tail -1 ../webbuild.log | cut -c1-100; cd .. && timeout 3300 python3 tests/run_all.py 2>&1 | tail -15"}],"uuid":"136eb0e5-d8fc-4c5a-8bb3-4721c41c4f4d","session_id":"c4040135-dd9a-415a-bbb7-ba7a9152393c"}
