{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkB1oNTfUm7zPbmtgqGg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked the hand-in against TASK.md, and everything it asks for is in `work/`, but I can't say the stop condition is met.\n\n**What TASK.md asks for, and what's in the folder:**\n- **Game file:** the single `.html`, named per TASK.md, is in the folder.\n- **Exit interview:** `exit-interview.json` is beside it. It has every Source Information field filled in, 4 testing, 6 engine and 4 prompt answers, and all ten `aiHub` fields. `usage` reads \"added on import\".\n- **About screen:** the page carries an `about-data` block.\n- **Dev subfolder:** the dev subfolder exists.\n\n**What PLAN.md still lacks** (these are the gaps I listed in my summary; they are real):\n- The HUD speaker cameo is a coloured initial, not the paper-rig face.\n- The Hush drains colour from the whole screen, not only from non-tissue.\n- Local co-op with more than one pad has had little testing.\n- Plates and character rigs are Rust code, not text data files.\n\nMara and Pet, Case Files, Code Blue and the hub round all work, and the tests pass (38 passed, 0 failed).\n\nFinishing the remaining items would take several more wasm rebuilds, each about 3 minutes, on a machine where other agents' builds keep running out of memory. I haven't done that work, so I'm not claiming the stop condition is met."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1096,"cache_read_input_tokens":656791,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1096},"output_tokens":465,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4040135-dd9a-415a-bbb7-ba7a9152393c","uuid":"13f4813c-2e37-4f06-af77-fb6e3cbc0c97","tim