{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkF6XMeQDGF4V6TcgQxc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't prove that a person can finish every case. That is a human judgement, and no test on this machine can make it. These are the closest substitutes I have.\n\n- **Campaign, same input interface:** every operation is driven through the same per-tick surgeon input a pad or mouse produces: an aim point, a held bit, a pressure value and a tool pick. The bot moves the cursor at a human speed of about 8 units per second and works through every case and the whole campaign on 10 seeds. At skill 0.4 it loses Case 6, so the later cases are not trivially easy.\n- **Controls, real devices:** the browser tests drive the actual controls and check the sim's response. They cover the stick flick, the right stick moving the cursor, analog R2 as the held trigger, Options pausing, number keys, mouse aim, click and wheel. They also cover a second pad joining Code Blue and the phone profile.\n- **Whole campaign in the browser:** the whole campaign reaches Won in the shipped file.\n\nI did not re-listen to audio, and I did not re-check every screen after the last build. I looked only at the Hush screen. I never played a case end to end through the browser's pad or mouse.\n\nThe hand-in files are in `work/`. This is the most I can verify here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":760,"cache_read_input_tokens":684071,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":760},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4040135-dd9a-415a-bbb7-ba7a9152393c","uuid":"9f44f641-0362-4ffa-9bad-188614ee955e","timestamp":"2026-11-05T18:20:27.690Z","request_id