{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkGXUfygwXtuJCSz1x9P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I re-read PLAN.md's requirements map and checked it against the built game. Almost every item is covered, but I still can't mark the stop condition as met, because the one requirement that needs a person playing is unverified.\n\n**Requirements map (PLAN.md), checked against the work:**\n- **Title riff, single constant, one HTML in a dev subfolder:** done.\n- **Built on the engine:** done.\n- **Art and animation:** done.\n- **Audio in code with gibberish voices:** music defaults to 10%, checked in the browser tests.\n- **AI Hub:** the shipped file carries the session client and the `hub:` tags. The harness passed 5 of 5 scenarios, plus a two-copy exchange.\n- **Headless tests behind one command:** `tests/run_all.py` reports 39 passed, 0 failed.\n- **Vertical slice with all mechanics:** the coverage test passes.\n- **Designer tools:** the content README, `pav case_check` and `pav balance` exist.\n- **Dev mode, attract mode, touch-only message:** all tested.\n- **10-foot, controller-first UI:** prompts follow the last device and the Xbox setting; tested.\n- **No stubs:** a search for TODO, FIXME and `todo!()` across the game's own source found nothing.\n- **Exit interview and About screen:** the About screen is embedded in the page, and `exit-interview.json` is in `work/`.\n\n**Still unverified:** §13 says a person with a pad or a mouse can finish the campaign and every case. I tried again with a smaller 640×360 window. `human_mouse_case0.py` plays Case 0 using only the real mouse and keyboard, with no bot and no sim commands. The browser tab was killed a third time (\"Mouse.move: Target crashed\"). The machine's memory is very low because of other agents' jobs, so I can't complete that run here. I have not re-listened to the audio.\n\nThe bot, driving the same per-tick input a pad or mouse produces, finishes every case and the whole campaign. The hand-in files are in `work/`: the `.html` and `exit-interview.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":284,"cache_read_input_tokens":695632,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":284},"output_tokens":700,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4040135-dd9a-415a-bbb7-ba7a9152393c","uuid":"4957d77c-1a74-4d62-b072-6d0f27c0ffcb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T18:39:07.207Z","request_id":"req_011CgkGXTGejLu9zus5GYZqM"}
