{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkGY1dpcW2SWRv6teJA5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't satisfy the one remaining requirement, and nothing more I can do on this machine would change that. It needs a person to finish the campaign and every case with a pad or a mouse, and no automated check can stand in for that.\n\n- **Human-play check:** I tried to play Case 0 through the real browser mouse and keyboard three times. The browser tab was killed each time with \"Target crashed\", which on this machine means the memory watchdog stepped in. Other agents' jobs are using nearly all the memory, and I can't change that. I'm not going to keep retrying the same run.\n- **Audio:** the audio tests run in the suite and pass. They check that every cue, voice and track renders non-silent, and that music defaults to 0.10. I have not listened to it.\n- **Re-reading the plan:** I re-read STAGE.md, PLAN.md §13 and the requirements map, and checked each item against the built game. Everything else on the map is covered, and the last full run reported 39 passed, 0 failed.\n\nThe bot, driving the same per-tick input a pad or mouse produces, finishes all nine cases and the whole campaign. The browser tests also drive the stick flick, analog R2, the mouse and the keyboard.\n\nThe hand-in files are in `work/`: the `.html` and `exit-interview.json`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":961,"cache_read_input_tokens":695916,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":961},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4040135-dd9a-415a-bbb7-ba7a9152393c","uuid":"d8f04523-eb88-443b-98c4-a033102447c6","timestamp":"2026-11-05T18:39: